{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_title", "source_sha256": "bc66bf2f5410617418d038d8adcf0bdc7bb194ce239f988f7e4a7fe44b717546", "ja": "1年生と2年生と3年生と", "zh": "1年级与2年级与3年级还有", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5662fde1c5574c985eab38e9e1b1c90291ffdcbba174037bf0b343aa466dd341", "ja": "恵美と仲が良さそうな桃子を複雑な面持ちで\n見送る環。海美との関係に悩む育。戸惑い\nながらも進む1年生達。生徒会選挙が波乱の\n様相を見せる中、3年生の紗代子、麗花、\n可憐は今度は自分達が見守る番だと話す。", "zh": "带着复杂的心情目送着似乎和惠美关系很好的桃子的环。为自己和海美的关系而烦恼的育。尽管困惑，1年级的学生们仍在前进。学生会选举显现出一片风波之际，3年级的纱代子、丽花和可怜说道，这次轮到她们来守望了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1000_se", "source_sha256": "f98f4cdb4e7b7d62a2dbbd0a5a370f5f947a3f027cc94e2530dd88cc113b1ccd", "ja": "キーンコーン\nカーンコーン", "zh": "叮——咚——\n铛——咚——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "a5e20135f70da794cf8fddde965149b69cf81b81d63279af041d5db57dcc6c0b", "ja": "ふぅ、やっと授業が終わった。……それにしても、\n選挙が近づいてきて、みんなそわそわしてるなぁ。", "zh": "呼，终于下课了。……不过话说回来，选举临近，大家都坐立不安的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "32aa8ee002407d9b9975c76383146b160a3569f5f55290b2deb7f78a34e5d11e", "ja": "ふ～ん……。", "zh": "是喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1003_null", "source_sha256": "fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc", "ja": "ザワザワ……", "zh": "一阵骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "30f8df5b5367c75b17f8d883c7b210dbc209e93bef5b5958110e72b9b47991d4", "ja": "おー、いたいた！　桃子、ちょっといい……\nあ、友達と一緒だった？　ごめんね、ジャマして。", "zh": "哦——找到了！桃子，稍微打扰一下……\n啊，你和朋友在一起吗？不好意思，打扰你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "f37a04783ff9fc59171b303b43dd75282611d243dfb4ba7e0fc24f0ddf247e3e", "ja": "いえ。あ、環さん。私のお姉さまで、所恵美さん。\nお姉さま、こちらはクラスメイトの環さんです。", "zh": "不会。啊，环。这位是我的姐姐，所惠美学姐。\n姐姐，这位是我的同班同学环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "1f1a129b9bc5123d9f80e4a6e1701e660662ffd6aff0b9d2d6c13d8715feaced", "ja": "あ、生徒会の……！\nはじめまして。大神環です。", "zh": "啊，学生会的……！\n初次见面，我是大神环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "2736a18da38de9494b9ac906dd29956efec6c9616b2bc12573af0064ec637ad6", "ja": "ご紹介にあずかった所恵美です！　環さん、\nうちの桃子と仲良くしてくれてありがとね！", "zh": "我是刚才介绍的所惠美！环，谢谢你和我们家桃子成为好朋友！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "db0c8b4f22ce4dc57e7970f8238165c7cfe0779d4a5a7b48f373350147153961", "ja": "桃子、ちょっと出られる？\n美奈子お姉さまが呼んでるんだ。", "zh": "桃子，能出来一下吗？\n美奈子姐姐在叫你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "763a79389830cd841266ec00a9e6056aa4c3551ec354f6ed080162b025546a27", "ja": "美奈子お姉さまが……わかりました。\n環さん、ごきげんよう。また明日。", "zh": "美奈子姐姐……知道了。环，回见。明天见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "269d7f9cf1cd1c9315b9ad4e4b8a0c9b6c43a2a303f8da052675311c70562ecf", "ja": "ごきげんよう。", "zh": "祝您安好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "bfb4b1dcf942d3a4b426fa72f871d7ac74c1de62b206ef6847dbaad7c2a6d335", "ja": "……。\nお姉さま、か。", "zh": "……\n姐姐大人，么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "afbe5a9c16ece00aa00e271cd7b8d43e807764be8b328bb8c9ab0229f081cf42", "ja": "今日は聖歌隊の活動もないし……\n早く帰ろうかな。", "zh": "今天也没有唱诗班的活动……\n要不早点回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "40574269a871b21b1f64e5d5ac187787f9b8236439c5a1eabe8bc04c7212e967", "ja": "環さん、もしかしてひとり？\nよかったら一緒に帰らない？", "zh": "环，你该不会是一个人吧？\n如果你不介意的话，要不要一起回去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "4875aef607bf0b4030d97f59d21b3312b93916d397049148cf6e2667bb2d76b6", "ja": "……うん、いいよ。", "zh": "……嗯，好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "cf428abab889288fde25fcd7b24b2159e7259c4aa3c1913ad34d094a180f3815", "ja": "……。\n話したいことがあるなら、聞くけど？", "zh": "……\n你要是有想说的事，环可以听哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "039f5b0abf790906998348d2bba25411cb9f80b59db0e12dd67b1fb40bc3f65d", "ja": "えっ……ど、どうして？", "zh": "诶……为、为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "cef2db487a07a3bc62570e2cb039323ac01eacbf527a174d743c3c891c3de283", "ja": "さっきから何度もため息ついてる。\n生徒会長と、海美さんのことでしょ。", "zh": "你从刚才开始就一直叹气。\n是因为学生会长和海美姐的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1019_030iku", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "f53daef7496795840e9cf20698db86a1b52ec70f3a7bb6b7f14b956b0bdbf53a", "ja": "大変だよね。転校してきてからずっと、\n注目の的になっちゃってて。", "zh": "真不容易呢。从转学过来之后，\n就一直备受关注。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "86441f8493c87cc0c0aa06ac4f462fdddd71a15d66e886087590cfae9c358dc9", "ja": "うん。でもそのお陰で、みんなと色々話しができて。\n海美さんの気持ちが、すこしわかった気がするんだ。", "zh": "嗯。不过也多亏了这样，我能和大家聊很多。\n感觉有点能理解海美的心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "36a7ba31fd1ca5eb1041db0fa04ab63753b6545b8a0639cb4f07f075db005483", "ja": "お姉さまを取られたように感じて、\n寂しかったんだって。", "zh": "因为感觉姐姐被人抢走了，所以很寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1023_040tam", "source_sha256": "a31e66032bf56e3072b16e73ac8a077c6077e996d0f9ef7b9ca13e27e20b1def", "ja": "お姉さまを、取られる……。", "zh": "姐姐要被抢走……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "1d59ad5f968b73d71c1e64ef43ac0cda239cd614560e25c63e4e2bd07d487358", "ja": "ふう……私ばっかり話しちゃった。\n聞いてくれてありがとう、環さん！", "zh": "呼……光顾着我说了。\n谢谢你听我说，环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "9a8ad7cff3d328e6b953e8972cdb4309509cb2c090cb61767ad5ab2fd104b1bd", "ja": "う、ううん。\n……。", "zh": "不、不用谢。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "165713a9cb592abf5c61efbaf1e1f0c0ae6d68d03f9ce7b53f12084824ff61fa", "ja": "今年の生徒会選挙は、混迷を極めていますね。\n当初予想していたより、だいぶ混戦になりそう。", "zh": "今年的学生会选举，真是陷入了极度混乱呢。\n看来会比最初预想的要激烈得多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "98944249a53df553055089bf7d408424c7a9295dab39593aa11399071cf09ca1", "ja": "うちの美希ちゃんも、やる気みたいだしね。\nしかも生徒会長狙い！", "zh": "我们家的美希也很有干劲呢。\n而且目标还是学生会长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "70a57c9612b28ab4626ac171fbae24e1b163cd2fd161d87b085ef7826892ec55", "ja": "それは、受け付けの時にも感じました。\n相手が海美さんなので、厳しそうではありますが……。", "zh": "这一点我在登记报名时也感受到了。对手是海美，看来会很艰难……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "8ec863e625556e66f8c75585afa0bf9d75cfc77f04218e76db9d81b959c4b889", "ja": "うん。でも、いいの。一緒にお昼寝して、\nずっと独り占めしてた美希ちゃんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯。不过，没关系的。虽然美希\n一直都在陪我睡午觉，被我一个人独占……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "3b74125572627c216f4390fee9860fd72ac6247faf22827367c748195253a5ec", "ja": "いつか飛び出していく日がくるって、\nそんなの、最初からわかってた事だから。", "zh": "总有一天会展翅高飞的，\n这种事，我从一开始就已经知道了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "e1e22b3b6c48b7672fd412da4c99c2e6eb0758d6612a2e05ccadea5211e6354a", "ja": "そうね。問題が全くないわけではないけど……\n私達も、お姉さまに見守ってきてもらったもの。", "zh": "是啊。也不是完全没有问题，只是……我们也一直是被姐姐看护着长大的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "21b18e06983d745650da775ce2e671887649c5feb90c8692a3a0897d6bbe2ec6", "ja": "今度は私たちが、見守る番って事だよね？", "zh": "这次轮到我们守护她们了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_09_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_09_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "59626fe5fb520bdd2579fc5f512b6a8c48cc5913946f5e4f41a3bc43a8bf42e0", "ja": "ええ。\nだから心配いらないわ。", "zh": "是的。\n所以不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
